Error [E0159]: `Door` has a `#State` or `#Transition` marker but no `state { … }` section
  --> tests/ui/typestate/state_section_shape_diagnostics_are_distinct_5.jet:2:27
    |
  2 | impl Door { #State(Ready) fn open(self) {} }
    |                           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Markers describe facts owned by the struct; without its declared set the marker cannot be checked or reflected
 Fix: Add one `state { Name, … }` section inside `struct Door`, or remove the typestate marker
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0159
